src/powerd-shim.c
  Rewrites the nvidia-powerd Dynamic Boost target. Descends from the author's
  own nvpcf-shim (gpu-power-policy a279bc4d, MIT); the 615.71.09 request layout
  was derived by disassembly and cross-checked against amagicai/nvpowerd-boost
  (MIT), an independent earlier implementation of the same technique. No code
  from it is used.

Provenance
  This project's in-memory power-policy edit, powerd target override and
  runtime current control were developed independently in the author's own
  research; the dated record is docs/history.md on the research/v0.1 branch,
  and docs/prior-art.md there maps related work with first-publication dates.
  The vendored loader patch replaced the author's earlier 595-series transport
  when the project moved to driver 615.

